# MedScan — local API keys (PRIVATE)

Copy this file to **`API_KEYS.local.md`** in the same folder and fill in your values.
`API_KEYS.local.md` is gitignored — do not commit it.

```powershell
copy docs\API_KEYS.local.md.example docs\API_KEYS.local.md
```

**Last updated:** _YYYY-MM-DD_

---

