## Mobile — `flutter run` / `flutter build`

| Dart define | Value |
|-------------|-------|
| `API_BASE_URL` | `https://medscan-api.azurewebsites.net` |
| `MEDSCAN_API_KEY` | _(same as `MEDSCAN_CLIENT_API_KEYS`)_ |
| `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` | _(same as `GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID`)_ |

